"""
Chart King V97 — AETHER Bookmap Whale Core

Single-file desktop dashboard.
Standard library only.

DATA:
- BTC/USD candles + live price: Coinbase Exchange public API.
- Kalshi market metadata / target / YES odds: Kalshi public Trade API.
- Kalshi BTC 15m settlement reference is CF Benchmarks BRTI, not Coinbase.
  Coinbase is therefore shown as a live BTC/USD GUIDE chart, while Kalshi's
  target price is drawn directly on that chart.

FEATURES:
- Instant 15m history on launch (no waiting for 5 new Kalshi candles)
- LIVE current 15m candle built from BTC ticker updates
- Current-15m NOWCAST
- NEXT 15m V22 prediction + silhouette
- EMA 9 / 21, RSI, ATR, candle anatomy, sweeps/reclaims, fast tape
- Support / resistance
- Fair Value Gaps (FVG)
- Hold vs Scalp regime
- Action / caution read
- Kalshi target, distance-to-target, YES bid/ask/last
- Mouse-wheel zoom + buttons
- Manual Kalshi ticker (recommended)
"""
