# BOOKMAP KING V21.47 — ULTRA SMOOTH DESKTOP PERFORMANCE GOVERNOR
#
# PERFORMANCE-ONLY LAYER:
# - Strategy/locks/MM3/HOLD/FLIP calculations are not modified.
# - Bookmap trade evidence is not dropped.
