# V21.67.2 GOLD MASTER QUEST SIDECAR
# READ-ONLY analytics added beside the winner brain:
#   1) BOOKMAP KING TUG OF WAR -- independent 4-family pressure read
#   2) MOVE BUDGET / SETTLEMENT VIABILITY -- can the locked path finish on time?
#
# CRITICAL INTEGRITY RULE:
#   * This section NEVER changes Open Lock, decision, reversal defense,
#     Flip Survival, paper entry side, or live-mirror behavior.
#   * It reads existing raw Bookmap/Kalshi state and renders an advisory card.
#   * The formulas are an independent implementation based on general market
#     microstructure concepts; they do not copy any third-party source code.
