# BTC / SOL / DOGE • ONE ADD-ON • ONE VISIBLE COCKPIT • THREE ISOLATED MINDS
#
# DESIGN CONTRACT
#   * V21.67 GOLD MASTER BTC decision/reversal/survival/Open-Lock functions are
#     not edited. This layer changes transport, presentation and per-asset state.
#   * Each asset is a separate ChartKingPro process/state universe using the
#     same indicator stack and same decision hierarchy. Inactive minds remain
#     live but their expensive chart painting is disabled.
#   * No cross-asset directional votes. BTC never influences SOL/DOGE and vice
#     versa. Same architecture, independent tape/depth/candles/locks/history.
#   * SOL/DOGE use asset-aware movement floors for Tug/Move/Journey sidecars so
#     BTC-dollar constants do not swamp small nominal prices.
#   * BTC keeps the exact pre-existing sidecar math and Gold Master brain.
#   * Live-money rail remains whatever V21.67 already allowed: preview only.
# ============================================================================

