# ============================================================================
# LECHART JAMES V21.91 — MOMENTUM BIAS INDEX / EARLY MOMENTUM SHIFT WATCH
#
# A lightweight lower-panel oscillator modeled after the user's visual example:
#   • green/red momentum histogram
#   • smoothed bias curve
#   • X markers at momentum wave peaks/troughs
#   • early SHIFT WATCH when momentum is still one color but decelerating
#   • 15s lead confirms/accelerates a 1m shift warning
#
# Safety / authority:
#   • This is NOT "green bar = UP contract" logic.
#   • Current Kalshi winner has ZERO input.
#   • MBI gets a small capped path vote and can strengthen an existing reversal
#     sequence, but cannot single-handedly flip MAIN LOCK.
#   • UI objects are preallocated and reused to avoid long-session Tk churn.
# ============================================================================
_V291_RELEASE='V21.91 MOMENTUM BIAS INDEX • EARLY SHIFT WATCH'
