# ============================================================================
# LECHART JAMES V21.98 — STANDALONE PYTHON • KALSHI CONTRACT CANDLES
#                          ADAPTIVE 0-180S OPPORTUNITY LOCK
#
# Inherits the V21.97 UI / flip meter / quant / target / settlement machinery.
# Bookmap is not required and is never opened.
#
# DATA SPLIT (intentional):
#   • Visible + short/contract MTF candles: Kalshi KXBTC15M YES contract prices.
#     - official 1m market candlesticks from Kalshi REST
#     - live current candle from Kalshi market quote polling
#     - 1s/3s/5s/15s/30s synthesized from live Kalshi YES quote ticks
#     - 3m/5m/10m/15m resampled from Kalshi 1m/ticks inside the contract
#   • Settlement geometry / target distance: underlying BTC public quote mesh,
#     because the Kalshi strike is a BTC dollar price and MUST NOT be compared to
#     a 0.00-1.00 contract-price candle.
#   • 1H / 4H regime context remains underlying BTC history for the same reason.
#
# LOCK POLICY:
#   • First 180 seconds are an opportunity window, not a mandatory wait.
#   • Easy/clean rounds may lock early after enough real evidence accumulates.
#   • Thresholds relax gradually as the window matures.
#   • At 180s James makes a deadline attempt, but NEVER fabricates a lock from
#     missing target/forecast data or obviously weak/noisy evidence.
#   • After commitment, inherited sticky PLAN CHANGED logic remains authoritative.
# ============================================================================
_V298_RELEASE='V21.98 STANDALONE KALSHI CANDLES • 3M OPPORTUNITY LOCK'
_V298_WINDOW_S=180.0
_V298_MIN_EVIDENCE_S=12.0
