# ============================================================================
# LECHART JAMES V21.98.5 — KALSHI BRTI DOLLAR CANDLES / EXACT V21.97 UI
#
# WHY THIS PATCH EXISTS
#   Kalshi *contract* candlesticks are probabilities (0.00..1.00).  They are not
#   the BTC price.  KXBTC15M settles from CF Benchmarks' Bitcoin Real-Time Index
#   (BRTI), exposed by Kalshi through its authenticated CF Benchmarks passthrough.
#
# FINAL DATA CONTRACT
#   • Visible chart + James TA / path / MBI / settlement geometry: Kalshi BRTI
#     BTC/USD values in real DOLLARS.
#   • User-entered KXBTC15M ticker: market identity + target strike + Kalshi BBO
#     used by Quant.  It never becomes the visible candle price.
#   • Bookmap: OFF.  Coinbase candle worker: OFF.  NightShark process: OFF.
#   • First MAIN LOCK opportunity: unchanged 0..180 seconds, may rip early.
#   • UI: exact V21.97 cockpit/priority rail, with one small Kalshi ticker box.
#
# PERFORMANCE CONTRACT
#   • One BRTI data worker.  No contract-candle worker.  No Coinbase worker.
#   • Background workers NEVER write Tk widgets directly; one low-frequency UI
#     pump publishes status strings on the Tk thread.
#   • Visual 60 Hz lane remains change-driven: BRTI ticks bump visual_seq only
#     when a new official index value actually arrives.
# ============================================================================
_V2985_RELEASE='V21.98.5 • KALSHI BRTI $ CANDLES • EXACT V21.97 UI • TRUE 3M LOCK'
_V2985_BASE_INIT=ChartKingPro.__init__
_V2985_BASE_DRAW=_V298_BASE_DRAW           # exact V21.97 draw path captured pre-standalone

import subprocess as _v2985_subprocess
import tempfile as _v2985_tempfile


