# =============================================================================
# Goal: preserve the exact V21.97 LeChart James cockpit and decision stack while
# making the standalone source unambiguous:
#   * chart/TA/MBI/path geometry = CF Benchmarks BRTI BTC/USD dollars via Kalshi
#   * KXBTC15M ticker = target/market/quant identity only
#   * NEVER render contract-price cents as BTC candles
