# V23.9.22.2 — CLOUD STANDALONE LIVE BTC AUTO-FEED HOTFIX
# =============================================================================
# Cloud-only market-data plumbing.  NO strategy/lock/RPP/Ichimoku/Blue logic is
# changed here.  The standalone lineage still owns every decision.  This patch
# only makes the live BTC lane self-starting on Railway when authenticated
# Kalshi CF-Benchmarks access is unavailable.
#
# Priority:
#   1) Authenticated Kalshi CF BRTI when credentials are present.
#   2) Coinbase public BTC/USD ticker as the live GUIDE feed.
#   3) Kraken public XBT/USD ticker fallback.
#   4) Bitstamp public BTC/USD ticker fallback.
#
# Historical candles remain the existing standalone public BTC/USD warmup.
