# =============================================================================
# V23.9.26 — RPP PRE-CONTACT SCENARIO ENGINE / FORWARD BARRIER MAP
# =============================================================================
# Purpose:
#   V23.9.25 became good at reading a reversal point once BTC was near/testing it.
#   This layer reasons about active RPP barriers BEFORE contact so the first-5m
#   lock can account for the likely reaction along the route to the strike.
#
# Design rules:
#   * AlgoAlpha RPP remains the structural source of levels/density.
#   * Forecasts are conditional scenarios, never literal reversal probabilities.
#   * Every nearby active RPP level is considered; target-corridor barriers get
#     extra weight, but nearby off-corridor levels are retained as alternate paths.
#   * Existing Tug/MBI/Ichimoku/Blue/1m confirmation and learned RPP behavior are
#     used to estimate BREAK vs HOLD before price arrives.
#   * The scenario layer may strengthen/weaken an ordinary lock candidate, but it
#     does not bypass stale-data guards, current-round target requirements, or the
#     existing first-five-minute lock framework.
# =============================================================================
_V23926_RELEASE='V23.9.26 RPP PRE-CONTACT SCENARIO • FORWARD BARRIER MAP'


